{"text": "WT Workshop

Build tools from parts, level them up by using them, and fill their slots with modifiers.

This book: book + stick."}

{"text": "1. Part Builder
Three planks over two sticks.

Blank patterns: sticks and planks in a 2x2 checkerboard (makes 8)."}

{"text": "6. Casting
Pour gold onto a pattern to make a reusable gold cast (2 ingots). Gold on any ingot makes an ingot cast.

Click a fluid in the tank to pour it."}
